        <h3 style="color: #2563EB; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 18px; line-height: 1.4;">၂။ ပညာရေးအချက်အလက်</h3>
        <div class="input-grid">
